en.memoryInjectConfirm:
Inject this memory into the current session?
A manually injected memory will not appear in the memory panel;
it is ordinary context and does not participate in automatic recall.

en.taskDeleteConfirm:
Delete task "{name}"?
The task moves to the trash and is purged automatically after 30 days;
it can be restored until then.

en.trashPurgeConfirm:
Permanently delete task "{name}"?
The task archive (subtasks, operations, pitfalls) will be removed for good;
this cannot be undone.
